{"id":18392,"author":"_TheTechnoFox_","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eWhen appealing for a temp-ban/ban on the Avicus Network, please include the following:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px 25px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cli\u003eYour minecraft\u0026nbsp;username (most recent name if changed) \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; It was firebird909, now it is _TheTechnoFox_\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eThe reason you were temp-banned/banned \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;I was banned for flying to the nebula game area\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eWhy you should be unbanned from the server.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eThere are some things to think about before making an appeal.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px 25px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cli\u003eWas my temp-ban or ban really false? \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; It was not false i'm sorry\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eDo I have any evidence to show the staff if was false? \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;no I don't\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eHave I waited long enough to be un-banned? \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; I have waited about 1\u0026amp;half years almost 2 years now.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eHave I been caught ban evading? \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;no i don't think i have ban evaded before, so no.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eHave I appealed a ban before? \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;no i have never appealed a ban ever.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eWhen appealing for a temp-ban/ban on the Avicus Network, please include the following:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px 25px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cli\u003eYour minecraft\u0026nbsp;username (most recent name if changed) \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; It was firebird909, now it is _TheTechnoFox_\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eThe reason you were temp-banned/banned \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;I was banned for flying to the nebula game area\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eWhy you should be unbanned from the server.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eThere are some things to think about before making an appeal.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px 25px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cli\u003eWas my temp-ban or ban really false? \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; It was not false i'm sorry\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eDo I ha